  "solution": {
    "brief": "Using the Rules from Aggregation component it is possible\r\nto extract the rules sequence that created one aggregation.\r\nThis sequence can then be used in a Graph-Grammar Aggregation\r\nprocess to recreate the aggregation.\r\nWhen recreating the aggregation, it is possible to modify the base\r\npart using the Transform Part component before aggregating.",
